# And I think your AI intuition is basically right

The future hierarchy may become something like:

```text
LEVEL 0
AI generated

LEVEL 1
AI generated + citations

LEVEL 2
citations resolve to actual evidence

LEVEL 3
argument/evidence mechanically audited

LEVEL 4
qualified human reviewed

LEVEL 5
named domain expert reviewed

LEVEL 6
multiple independent experts corroborated

LEVEL 7
living scholarly consensus / canonical reference
```

But critically:

**higher ≠ true.**

It means:

> increasingly accountable evidence and verification.

A brilliant new claim may initially sit at level 2 while a false orthodox belief sits at level 6.

That's why Pāṭala should preserve:

```text
evidence
warrant
reviewer
date
scope
confidence
defeaters
dissent
version
```

rather than collapsing everything into ✓.

