Not Academia.

Not Wikipedia.

Not a journal.

Not merely a knowledge graph.

### **Pāṭala = Proof-of-Scholarship infrastructure.**

Something like:

```text
             PRIMARY EVIDENCE
                   │
             manuscript/text
                   │
                   ▼
              PROPOSITION
